<body>
<div class="shell">
<aside class="side"><div class="logo">Rainbow AI</div><div class="spectrum"></div><nav class="nav"><a class="active" href="/rainbow-ai/">Commander</a><a href="/">LeadsIndia Home</a><a href="/admin/properties.php">Property Admin</a><a href="/properties">Live Marketplace</a></nav></aside>
<main class="main">
<header class="top"><div><h1>Business Command Center</h1><p>Business Owner is the active master orchestrator. Product Manager is ready for product work. External spend, publishing, bulk messaging and CRM mutations remain approval-gated.</p></div><span class="status loading" id="apiStatus">Checking connection…</span></header>
<section class="composer"><textarea id="command" maxlength="4000" aria-label="Business command" placeholder="Tell Rainbow AI what business outcome you want."></textarea><div class="row"><div class="muted" id="charCount">0 / 4000</div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" id="voice" type="button">Voice Input</button><button class="btn primary" id="send" type="button">Send Command</button></div></div><div class="errorbox" id="errorBox" role="alert"></div></section>
